<title>FRANCE: Block trade of 350,000 shares in UAP. [CORRECTED 10:03 GMT]</title>
<headline>Block trade of 350,000 shares in UAP. [CORRECTED 10:03 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects figure in headline from 250,000)</p>
<p>A block trade of 350,000 shares in UAP passed at 101.20 francs per share at 0841 GMT, traders said.</p>
